   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Approved narration MP3 in; finished 9:16 video out, in the style of the approved fire-ant video. 19 Oct 2026.\nA: the standard.  B: how we got here.  C: the automation (designed, not built).  D: problems, models, files, next.\nFar right: the whole thing in plain words, from the very beginning, with options and what-ifs for every step.",
   "originalText": "Approved narration MP3 in; finished 9:16 video out, in the style of the approved fire-ant video. 19 Oct 2026.\nA: the standard.  B: how we got here.  C: the automation (designed, not built).  D: problems, models, files, next.\nFar right: the whole thing in plain words, from the very beginning, with options and what-ifs for every step.",
