   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Hook v1: \"It's really good ... I do like everything about it.\"\nFull v2: \"very, very good ... the design, how it flows, how it does stuff is very, very good.\"\nHis rule: keep this style for every video.",
   "originalText": "Hook v1: \"It's really good ... I do like everything about it.\"\nFull v2: \"very, very good ... the design, how it flows, how it does stuff is very, very good.\"\nHis rule: keep this style for every video.",
