   "text": "CHECK                  TARGET          APPROVED\nFormat                 1080x1920 30fps pass\nAudio and video        same length, 0  79.2 s each\nLongest nearly still   at most 0.35 s  0.33 s\nChange per half second at least 15%    17%\nHook after kit changes pixel-identical pass",
   "originalText": "CHECK                  TARGET          APPROVED\nFormat                 1080x1920 30fps pass\nAudio and video        same length, 0  79.2 s each\nLongest nearly still   at most 0.35 s  0.33 s\nChange per half second at least 15%    17%\nHook after kit changes pixel-identical pass",
