   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every word captioned once, in order, 1-4 per group.\nEvery beat starts on a word.\nNo shot over 2 s; hook shots 0.7-1.5 s.\nSegments 6-15 s, end to end, no gaps.\nFails: back to the Director with the errors.",
