   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Risky = the first segment Sol or Astra makes,\nor the first with new drawings.\n\nDrew watches the clip on the Desktop or board.\nHis notes go back to the Animator.\n\n19 Oct: Drew approved the hook first; then the\nfull video was made.\n\nDrew's choice, 19 Oct: risky runs only.",
