   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Maps each failed check or note to\na stage and a time range.\n\nShot problem: redo those segments.\nPlan problem: re-plan that stretch.\nCaption timing: re-time those words.\nUnclear note: ask Drew (multiple choice).\nOutro timing: fix the join, voice or captions.\nMusic note: saved for later.\nUntouched segments stay pixel-identical.\nThen join, render, check, deliver v2.",
