   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Quality failure: the same model retries with notes.\nAvailability failure: next model down, or pause.\nEvery job gets a shell, file writing and image viewing.\nEvery job sees frames from the approved video.\nSubscriptions only; no paid API calls.",
