   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Each step saves its files, then marks itself done.\nRe-running the same command resumes; finished work is kept.\nA half-finished AI job restarts its segment.\nWaits on: its start time, Drew's verdict, a usage\nreset (automatic), or a parked failure (Drew decides).",
   "originalText": "Each step saves its files, then marks itself done.\nRe-running the same command resumes; finished work is kept.\nA half-finished AI job restarts its segment.\nWaits on: its start time, Drew's verdict, a usage\nreset (automatic), or a parked failure (Drew decides).",
