   "text": "\u2022 Claude runs out midway: save the work and wait.\n\u2022 Claude is available again: continue from the saved work.\n\u2022 It touches a file it shouldn't: the file is put back.\n\u2022 A piece takes over 3 hours: that counts as a failed try.\n\u2022 The computer restarts: finished pieces are kept, and it\n  picks up from the last one.",
   "originalText": "\u2022 Claude runs out midway: save the work and wait.\n\u2022 Claude is available again: continue from the saved work.\n\u2022 It touches a file it shouldn't: the file is put back.\n\u2022 A piece takes over 3 hours: that counts as a failed try.\n\u2022 The computer restarts: finished pieces are kept, and it\n  picks up from the last one.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
