   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u2022 Approve.\n\u2022 Give notes: only those parts are redone, and version 2\n  lands on your Desktop.\n\u2022 An unclear note: you get one multiple-choice question.\n\u2022 Outro timing: fix the join, voice or captions.\n\u2022 Music: saved for later.",
   "originalText": "\u2022 Approve.\n\u2022 Give notes: only those parts are redone, and version 2\n  lands on your Desktop.\n\u2022 An unclear note: you get one multiple-choice question.\n\u2022 Outro timing: fix the join, voice or captions.\n\u2022 Music: saved for later.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
