   "text": "VIDEO-FLOW.md          the recipe and quality bar\nHARNESS-NOTES.md       what worked; requirements\nKIT-API.md             what the kit and sets draw\nchoreography/          director and animator prompts\nscenes/\n  paper-kit.mjs        paper pieces, fire-ant worker,\n                       brood, captions, camera, effects\n  nest-world.mjs       nest cutaway: weather, water,\n                       heat, brood, ants\n  yard-world.mjs       yard, homeowner, magnifier,\n                       gauge, pushpin, X, question mark\n  hook, body and full  the approved video's modules\nrender-shots.mjs       --sheet, --at, --check-motion,\n                       full MP4 render\ntools/align_words.py   word timing, 3 local models\nmake_video.py          runner: prepare, full, segment,\n                       render, deliver\nscience-notes.md       anatomy and science limits\nbrand.json             the Deep Six palette\nepisodes/D6-6c917b49743b/\n  full/                approved v2 and its records\n  hook/                approved hook v1\n  model-test/          Opus, Sol and Astra tests\n  runs/astra-ending/   Astra's half-done full run\n\nTimes everywhere are seconds from the start of\nthe approved MP3.",
   "originalText": "VIDEO-FLOW.md          the recipe and quality bar\nHARNESS-NOTES.md       what worked; requirements\nKIT-API.md             what the kit and sets draw\nchoreography/          director and animator prompts\nscenes/\n  paper-kit.mjs        paper pieces, fire-ant worker,\n                       brood, captions, camera, effects\n  nest-world.mjs       nest cutaway: weather, water,\n                       heat, brood, ants\n  yard-world.mjs       yard, homeowner, magnifier,\n                       gauge, pushpin, X, question mark\n  hook, body and full  the approved video's modules\nrender-shots.mjs       --sheet, --at, --check-motion,\n                       full MP4 render\ntools/align_words.py   word timing, 3 local models\nmake_video.py          runner: prepare, full, segment,\n                       render, deliver\nscience-notes.md       anatomy and science limits\nbrand.json             the Deep Six palette\nepisodes/D6-6c917b49743b/\n  full/                approved v2 and its records\n  hook/                approved hook v1\n  model-test/          Opus, Sol and Astra tests\n  runs/astra-ending/   Astra's half-done full run\n\nTimes everywhere are seconds from the start of\nthe approved MP3.",
