   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Save queries, publications, dates, useful leads and failure reasons.\nCarry good unfinished candidates into the next search batch.\nRevisit promising authors and publications as the queue needs stock.\nOld but unused evidence can still support a new lesson.\nKeep source approval separate from discovering a candidate.",
   "originalText": "Save queries, publications, dates, useful leads and failure reasons.\nCarry good unfinished candidates into the next search batch.\nRevisit promising authors and publications as the queue needs stock.\nOld but unused evidence can still support a new lesson.\nKeep source approval separate from discovering a candidate.",
