   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A matching quote does not prove the claim drawn from it.\nCheck that each fact supports the hook or explanation.\nFive sites copying one study are one evidence origin.\nKeep species, location, dates and uncertainties attached.\nDo not choose only evidence that agrees with the hook.",
   "originalText": "A matching quote does not prove the claim drawn from it.\nCheck that each fact supports the hook or explanation.\nFive sites copying one study are one evidence origin.\nKeep species, location, dates and uncertainties attached.\nDo not choose only evidence that agrees with the hook.",
