   "text": "Changed or unreadable saved source: hold it for recheck.\nDo not erase the other liked sources or restart the whole queue.\nChanged pest/source/hook: invalidate dependent work only.\nLate results for the old choice must not enter the new episode.\nResume saved work after interruption; check active reservations.",
