   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every script opens with the exact hook and answers it right away.\nOne clear lesson each. Facts are material, not a checklist.\nPlain spoken words. Explain names. Something to notice or do.\nNo source names or credits spoken. No em dashes. No word target.\nDrew can ask for one focused script instead of five.",
