   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Model limit or outage: switch to the backup and keep every choice.\nBroken answer: stop that step. Do not quietly retry other models.\nInterrupted run: bring back the waiting review. Never start a second one.\nA late result from an older request is ignored.\nEvidence is saved before writing, so a crash never repeats research.",
   "originalText": "Model limit or outage: switch to the backup and keep every choice.\nBroken answer: stop that step. Do not quietly retry other models.\nInterrupted run: bring back the waiting review. Never start a second one.\nA late result from an older request is ignored.\nEvidence is saved before writing, so a crash never repeats research.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
