   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Each round, Claude changes something real: angle, order,\nending or the facts used. It says what changed in one plain line.\nAfter several misses, offer one focused script or more research.\nNever ask Drew to explain or diagnose the writing.",
