   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Voice: Tyler. Model: eleven_v4. Seed: 20261019. Format: mp3_44100_128.\nStability 0.5, similarity 0.75. Same settings prepared for the wasp take.\nRender text: [curious, conversational] A fire ant colony doesn't...\nRemove the [hints] and the words equal the approved script exactly.\nResult: 78.6 seconds. Drew: \"I love it.\" Approval bound to the MP3 fingerprint.\n\nWasp take: Chris, 885 characters, same settings. Run by another session.",
   "originalText": "Voice: Tyler. Model: eleven_v4. Seed: 20261019. Format: mp3_44100_128.\nStability 0.5, similarity 0.75. Same settings prepared for the wasp take.\nRender text: [curious, conversational] A fire ant colony doesn't...\nRemove the [hints] and the words equal the approved script exactly.\nResult: 78.6 seconds. Drew: \"I love it.\" Approval bound to the MP3 fingerprint.\n\nWasp take: Chris, 885 characters, same settings. Run by another session.",
