   "locked": false,
   "text": "Built: voice rotation, word-match check on the read, spending limit per\nyes, lock against double requests, fingerprinted approval of the MP3.\nBuilt for video: offline word timing with three speech models.\nStill needed: run that word check here, automatic Desktop copy,\none resume screen, a standing spending cap (Drew decides).",
