   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Wrong pronunciation: test only that phrase, then one new full take.\nFlat or odd delivery: test the hook in the same voice first.\nVoice disliked: short hook tests in other voices. Drew picks.\nEvery new take needs a new yes from Drew (step 19).\nWrong words: back to narration; the script needs new approval.",
   "originalText": "Wrong pronunciation: test only that phrase, then one new full take.\nFlat or odd delivery: test the hook in the same voice first.\nVoice disliked: short hook tests in other voices. Drew picks.\nEvery new take needs a new yes from Drew (step 19).\nWrong words: back to narration; the script needs new approval.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
